          answer: "- Class: Order\n- - orderNumber : integer\n- - customerName : string\n- - pizzaOrder : array[10] of Pizza\n- - deliveryAgent : Agent\n- + Order(oN : integer, cN : string, pO : array of Pizza, dA : Agent)\n- + getOrderNumber() : integer\n- + getDeliveryAgent() : Agent\n- + setPizzaOrder(pO : array of Pizza)\n- + setDeliveryAgent(dA : Agent)\n- + toString() : string",
