          answer: "- Input the first month's name and price\n- Set lowMonth to that month and minPrice to that price (initialise)\n- Loop for months 2 to 12\n- Inside the loop input the month's name\n- and input its price\n- If price < minPrice\n- then minPrice <- price\n- and lowMonth <- month\n- End the loop\n- Output lowMonth",
